---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
// Placeholder copy: have this reviewed before launch.
---
<BaseLayout title="What I do with the details you send" description="What I keep from a brief, why, how long, and your rights under UK GDPR.">
  <section class="sh-section">
    <div class="sh-container sh-container--narrow">
      <p class="sh-meta sh-privacy__eyebrow">Privacy</p>
      <h1 class="sh-d-xl sh-privacy__title">What I do with the details you send</h1>
      <div class="sh-prose">
        <p>This page covers what I keep when you send a brief through this site, why I keep it, how long, and what you can ask me to do about it.</p>

        <h2 class="sh-d-s sh-privacy__h">What I keep</h2>
        <p>From a brief I keep your name, your company, your email address, and the shoot details: the type of shoot, a preferred date, the budget range and the brief itself. If we talk by phone or WhatsApp, I keep a note of what we agreed in the same place.</p>

        <h2 class="sh-d-s sh-privacy__h">Why I keep it</h2>
        <p>To answer your brief, put together a quote and, if you book, run the shoot and send the files. I use it for nothing else.</p>

        <h2 class="sh-d-s sh-privacy__h">Who sees it</h2>
        <p>I do not sell or share your details, and I do not add you to a mailing list.</p>

        <h2 class="sh-d-s sh-privacy__h">How long I keep it</h2>
        <p>I keep a brief for 12 months from our last contact. If we book a shoot, the details stay on file for 12 months after the last job, and then they are deleted.</p>

        <h2 class="sh-d-s sh-privacy__h">Photographs from shoots</h2>
        <p>I publish photographs of people from a shoot only with the client's agreement, agreed before the day. If you change your mind, write to me and I will take the picture down from my site and my social channels.</p>

        <h2 class="sh-d-s sh-privacy__h">Your rights under UK GDPR</h2>
        <p>You can ask me to show you what I hold about you, to correct anything that is wrong, or to delete your details. Write to <a class="sh-link" href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a> and I will act on it.</p>

        <h2 class="sh-d-s sh-privacy__h">Complaints</h2>
        <p>If you think I have handled your details badly, you can complain to the Information Commissioner's Office (ICO) at <a class="sh-link" href="https://ico.org.uk" rel="noopener">ico.org.uk</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
